    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:120pt;">
      <p style="font-size:10pt; letter-spacing:2pt; color:#0f766e; margin-bottom:6pt;">MENTOR LAB / SOURCE COMPANION</p>
      <p style="font-size:32pt; font-weight:bold; color:#0b1f3a; line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 8pt 0;">Code Analysis &amp; Command Guide</p>
      <p style="font-size:10.5pt; color:#5a6b74; margin:0 0 18pt 0;">React + Vite  |  Node.js + Express 5  |  MongoDB + Mongoose  |  JWT + bcrypt  |  GridFS  |  Razorpay / UPI  |  Groq AI</p>
      <p style="font-size:12pt; color:#40525e; line-height:1.5; margin:0 0 80pt 0;">A source-level walkthrough of the Mentor Lab education platform: setup commands, backend controllers and routes, frontend pages, data models, request flows, security findings, debugging playbook, and viva-ready explanations.</p>
      <p style="font-size:9pt; color:#5a6b74; line-height:1.45;">Use this guide as a reading companion to the source code. Every important function is explained in context, with file references so you can jump directly to the implementation. Secrets and real credentials are deliberately excluded.</p>
      <p style="font-size:9pt; color:#5a6b74; margin-top:70pt;">Mentor Lab &nbsp;|&nbsp; Full-stack education website project &nbsp;|&nbsp; Edition 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-break"></div>
  


