    <p style="font-size:9pt; color:#5a6b74; background:#f2f8f7; padding:8pt 10pt; margin-top:14pt;">Scope and accuracy. This guide describes the code that is present in the project folder. Where the implementation is incomplete, insecure, duplicated, or inconsistent, that is stated directly rather than hidden. The guide never prints the values of MONGO_URI, JWT_SECRET, GROQ_API_KEY, SMTP passwords, Razorpay secrets, or the hard-coded admin credentials. Commands use placeholder values and are safe to adapt.</p>
